# Verify the change against the plan

Before a multi-file edit, call `plan_change` via Open Kioku. It returns the files
expected to change and an explicit edit boundary. Apply the edit with your normal
editor — Open Kioku never writes source.

After the edit, call `verify_change` with that plan (save it with
`format: "json"`) or with a `contract_id` from `plan_change` with
`persist: true`. It compares the files that actually changed against the boundary
that was declared. A green test run is not proof the right files changed.
